From: =?UTF-8?q?Erik=20Spr=C3=A5ng?= <sprang@webrtc.org>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 13:42:43 +0200
Subject: Handle failed I420 conversion in VideoFrameSampler::Create
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Return nullptr from VideoFrameSampler::Create when the underlying
frame buffer accessor or ToI420ForInspection() returns nullptr, and
check ToI420ForInspection() before allocating the scaled buffer in
GetSampleValuesForFrame.

Bug: webrtc:574312303
Change-Id: I1654cba6437269b1627c7a532a6245228d4e6b9b
Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/509480
Reviewed-by: Ilya Nikolaevskiy <ilnik@webrtc.org>
Commit-Queue: Erik Språng <sprang@webrtc.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48942}

